  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A market tote basket is 22 cm across and 25 cm tall with two 45 cm "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "strap-chain"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "strap handles"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The base is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-tote"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dc spiral. Super-chunky rope on a 10 mm hook gives a rigid base and sides."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Total yardage is around 250 m for the body and 50 m for both straps."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Super-chunky cotton rope",
              "qty": "300 m total"
            },
            {
              "name": "10 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Stitch marker",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base and sides"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Follow the basic round basket base to 22 cm diameter (rounds 1 to 8, 64 dc). BLO fold round. Work sides straight for 25 cm (approximately 20 rounds). Sl st to close. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Straps (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mark four points on the basket rim: two on one side 6 cm apart, and two opposite. For each strap: join rope at one mark. Ch 60. Sl st into the second mark. Work dc back across the ch-60. Fasten off. Repeat for the second strap."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Secure all tails with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "weaving-in-ends"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "weaving in ends"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The two long straps allow the tote to be carried over one shoulder."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Spot clean. Machine wash if the rope label allows. Stand upright while damp."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The handled market basket uses short loop handles instead. Or try the tall round basket for a deeper version without handles."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}